# The in-game cheat list (v0.8 P2, docs/plans/cheat-guides.md) over
# Hello.gba with tests/shots/data/ingame-hello.cht: only the picks are
# listed (the master code and Not picked aren't), the first cheat under the
# cursor. The footer shows the cursor's cheat's activation, unless it can't
# change: Infinite lives is always on (always); A turns it off (off); DOWN
# to the long name, cut with "..." (cut), which scrolls sideways once the
# cursor rests (marquee) to its end, where it pauses (end); Moon jump's code
# holds A (hold); Warp's keys line says press (press); A or B's code holds
# two combinations: no sentence, the toggles' note (unknown); Skip the
# intro patches the ROM and Pick a level is a placeholder: their reasons
# win (locked, cant).
#! settings 2=1
#! sd-file /torii/cheats/Hello.cht 0 tests/shots/data/ingame-hello.cht
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Hello.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:0x7E000002
-w "launch: starting the game"
-k @300:L+R+START -k @306:-
-w "screen ready: ingame"
-k @20:DOWN -k @24:- -k @32:DOWN -k @36:- -k @44:A -k @48:-
-w "screen ready: ingame-cheats"
-s @4:always.png
-k @10:A -k @14:-
-s @24:off.png
-k @30:DOWN -k @34:-
-s @44:cut.png
-s @120:marquee.png
-s @250:end.png
-k @300:DOWN -k @304:-
-s @314:hold.png
-k @320:DOWN -k @324:-
-s @334:press.png
-k @340:DOWN -k @344:-
-s @354:unknown.png
-k @360:DOWN -k @364:-
-s @374:locked.png
-k @380:DOWN -k @384:-
-s @394:cant.png
